    -> I'm new to the area. Any tips?
        Ratlucia: Heh, well, good luck out here. But if I had to say anything...
        Ratlucia: If you're looking for a quick way to earn money, try the casino.
        Ratlucia: High risk, but high reward.
    -> Interested in some cheese?
